(
K05 / C5 (2026-10-07): contact_target_geometry (manual Professional
6.106) is the Professional name of contact_geometry and works for
every index. 1D, test other/contac2 of the Professional 02-08-2026
with the target geometry on index 1: node 2 starts at 0.99 with
velx 0.03; geometry_point 1 (x = 1.3, tolerance 0.3, outward normal
+x) holds it: after one step of 1, node 2 x = 1.0 (Professional 1.0).
GNU before: index > 0 was dropped, node 2 x = 1.02 (free flight).
)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 1
materi_velocity
materi_stress
end_initia
mesh -follow_material
node 1  0.
node 2  0.99
element 1  -bar2  1 2
group_type 0  -materi
group_materi_density 0  1.
geometry_point 1  1.3 0.3
node_dof 2  0.03  0. 0. 0. 0. 0. 0.
contact_penalty_velocity  10.
contact_target_geometry 1  -geometry_point 1
timestep_predict_velocity -yes
control_timestep  10  1. 1.
target_item  1  -node 2 0
target_value 1  1.0 1.e-3
end_data
